_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-09-07T12:07:40Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T06:35:37Z","closed_at":"2025-09-07T13:05:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.5 dev1 and later\n- Not reproducible in Godot 4.4.1 stable\n\n### System information\n\nLinux - Godot 4.5 rc1\n\n### Issue description\n\nWith VC_CHARS_BEFORE_SHAPING set on a RichTextLabel, the label should resize to match the visible character count. This no longer happens in Godot 4.5 dev1 and up. The text instead maintains its size as if all the characters were visible.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open control.tscn in the MRP\n2. Select RichTextLabel\n3. Move the \"Visible Ratio\" slider.\n\nMoving the \"Visible Ratio\" slider in Godot 4.4.1 stable:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f3823d2-2b8f-4822-a321-a93c116881c7\n\n\nMoving the \"Visible Ratio\" slider in Godot 4.5 rc1\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3005be15-eb0f-4c3f-9b00-dbf0129fef63\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22196498/MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"leekleak","id":142348248,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHwP2A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142348